[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=aikey: explain the active window
Comment=Screenshot the active window; the local LLM explains it and you can ask follow-up questions
Exec=aikey --screen
Icon=spectacle
Categories=Utility;
X-KDE-Shortcuts=Meta+Shift+W,Meta+Ctrl+Alt+Shift+F23,Meta+Ctrl+Alt+Shift+Touchpad Off
